hich returns the latest committed","+\t/// state of the selected rows, waiting for the outcome of any concurrent","+\t/// uncommitted write to them, instead of returning state from a snapshot.","+\t/// Hibernate performs a current read for the version check it executes","+\t/// just before commit for an entity locked in [LockMode#OPTIMISTIC] mode.","+\t///","+\t/// When plain reads [already wait][Metadata#readsWaitForUncommittedWrites]","+\t/// nothing is rendered, since a plain read is already a current read.","+\t/// Otherwise, by default, a [PessimisticLockStyle#TABLE_HINT] profile","+\t/// renders its share-lock hint, and other profiles render nothing. A","+\t/// profile may override this to render a cheaper form which waits for","+\t/// the outcome of concurrent writes but retains no lock.","+\t///","+\t/// @param tableExpression The table reference the hint will follow","+\t///","+\t/// @since 8.0","+\t/// @see #renderCurrentReadClause()","+\t/// @see Metadata#readsWaitForUncommittedWrites()","+\t@SPI(SUPPLY)","+\tdefault String renderCurrentReadTableHint(String tableExpression) {","+\t\tfinal Metadata metadata = getMetadata();","+\t\treturn !metadata.readsWaitForUncommittedWrites()","+\t\t\t&& metadata.getPessimisticLockStyle() == PessimisticLockStyle.TABLE_HINT","+\t\t\t\t? TableLockHintRendererSupport.renderHint(","+\t\t\t\t\t\tthis, LockMode.PESSIMISTIC_READ, Timeouts.WAIT_FOREVER, tableExpression )","+\t\t\t\t: \"\";","+\t}","+","+\t/// Renders the clause, if any, which, appended to a simple single-table","+\t/// `select`, makes it a current read, as described for","+\t/// [#renderCurrentReadTableHint].","+\t///","+\t/// When plain reads [already wait][Metadata#readsWaitForUncommittedWrites]","+\t/// nothing is rendered. Otherwise, by default, a [PessimisticLockStyle#CLAUSE]","+\t/// profile renders its share-lock clause, and other profiles render nothing.","+\t/// A profile may override this to render a cheaper form which waits for","+\t/// the outcome o